<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
  <a href="/stock_entries" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm gap-1 mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke Barang Masuk</a>
  <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-excel text-success"></i> Upload Barang Masuk dari Excel</h1>
      <p class="text-sm opacity-60 mt-1">File <b>.xlsx / .xls / .csv</b> — header: <span class="font-mono text-xs">No_Pembelian, Tanggal, Supplier, Kode_Barang, Jumlah, Keterangan</span> (Nama_Barang opsional, Harga_Modal opsional)</p>
      <div class="alert bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 mt-4 py-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-amber-600"></i>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs opacity-70">
            <li>Kode_Barang harus sudah ada di Data Barang.</li>
            <li>No_Pembelian duplikat akan di-skip.</li>
            <li>Tanggal format: YYYY-MM-DD atau DD/MM/YYYY.</li>
            <li><a href="/stock_entries/template.xlsx" class="link link-primary">Download template Excel</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%= form_with url: import_stock_entries_path, method: :post, multipart: true, class: "mt-4 space-y-4" do |f| %>
        <input type="file" name="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" required class="file-input file-input-bordered file-input-primary w-full" />
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-upload"></i> Upload & Import</button>
          <a href="/stock_entries" class="btn btn-ghost">Batal</a>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
